# DISPATCH-LEDGER - launch register (schema template)

One row per launch, written before the process starts. This template carries the fixed columns
and an empty state; it contains no live rows. A process may not be launched when its row is
missing. Append-only: rows are never rewritten or removed.

## Columns (fixed)

| column | meaning |
|---|---|
| task id | `<project>-<unit>-<n>`, unique |
| owner role | the role that owns the unit |
| model (verified) | the provider and model read from that role's own configuration immediately before launch |
| domain | the domain the unit belongs to |
| allowed decisions | what the unit may decide |
| forbidden decisions | what the unit may not decide |
| owned files | the exact paths the unit may write |
| upstream artifact | the stable input the unit builds on |
| launch session id | filled from the launch's own output log, never prewritten |
| exit artifact | the artifact the unit must leave behind, with its acceptance bar |

